  "sourceInterpretation": "Official image reports ESP-IDF v6.1-dirty,exact private source revision unknown. Public cache_err_int.c/cache LL/registers fixed to fff9895c82d744c7237be8847347bdd1b07c6643; TRM pre-release0.1 glossary pages1087\u20131088 distinguishes WT/WTC from W1C.",
