      "Physical requester ID/ATTR/address capture",
      "Unmodeled MMU/access-error causes",
      "Complete fail-propagation masking: strict diagnostic faults retained,no substitute data",
      "Cache-line timing,DMA/coherence",
      "Clock calibration and remaining Plus board/display peripherals"
